WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.171 --> 00:00:07.211
A security guard walked through the Metro City Art Museum one night.

2
00:00:07.212 --> 00:00:14.107
"I love my job," she said. "I get to look at all these wonderful paintings."

3
00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:18.699
She walked into a gallery and gasped.

4
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.534
"Somebody sprayed paint all over the walls!"

5
00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:25.922
She heard footsteps and spun around.

6
00:00:25.923 --> 00:00:33.099
A dark figure rushed toward her!

7
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.720
"This is a fun project," Mara said.

8
00:00:36.721 --> 00:00:39.359
Roxy and her friends were in downtown Metro City.

9
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.935
Their art class was painting a mural on a building.

10
00:00:42.936 --> 00:00:44.976
Terrell mixed a dark green color.

11
00:00:44.977 --> 00:00:48.880
He dipped his brush in the paint. Then he painted a tree.

12
00:00:48.881 --> 00:00:52.681
"That tree looks great, Terrell," Roxy said.

13
00:00:52.682 --> 00:00:55.898
She was working on an area of sky.

14
00:00:55.899 --> 00:00:58.202
Mara stepped back and looked at the mural.

15
00:00:58.203 --> 00:01:01.528
"I think I'll add some birds to that sky."

16
00:01:01.529 --> 00:01:06.404
"Watch this!" Jack was standing in front of a blank area of the wall.

17
00:01:06.405 --> 00:01:10.227
He swung his brush. Drops of paint flew off the brush.

18
00:01:10.228 --> 00:01:12.445
They splattered across the wall.

19
00:01:12.446 --> 00:01:14.857
"Ha-ha!" Terrell laughed.

20
00:01:14.858 --> 00:01:17.978
Jack dipped his brush in a different color.

21
00:01:17.979 --> 00:01:19.848
He splattered the wall again.

22
00:01:19.849 --> 00:01:23.278
Drips of paint zigzagged all over the wall.

23
00:01:23.279 --> 00:01:30.218
Mara frowned. "You're ruining the mural, Jack! I wish you'd take this seriously."

24
00:01:30.219 --> 00:01:33.994
Roxy looked at the mess Jack had made.

25
00:01:33.995 --> 00:01:37.290
"You know what, Jack? I kind of like it."

26
00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:40.095
Mara raised an eyebrow. "Really?"

27
00:01:40.096 --> 00:01:42.940
Mr. Barns, the art teacher, walked over.

28
00:01:42.941 --> 00:01:46.251
"Uh-oh!" Jack put down his brush.

29
00:01:46.252 --> 00:01:48.977
Mr. Barns folded his arms across his chest.

30
00:01:48.978 --> 00:01:50.958
He stared at the wall.

31
00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:55.283
Terrell whispered to Jack. "You're in big trouble."

32
00:01:55.284 --> 00:01:57.872
For a moment Mr. Barns was silent.

33
00:01:57.873 --> 00:02:00.788
Then he said, "I like this."

34
00:02:00.789 --> 00:02:03.437
"Really?" Terrell said.

35
00:02:03.438 --> 00:02:07.337
"Isn't it just a mess?" Mara asked.

36
00:02:07.338 --> 00:02:11.280
Mr. Barns smiled. "No. It's abstract art."

37
00:02:11.281 --> 00:02:14.754
Jack scratched his head. "It is?"

38
00:02:14.755 --> 00:02:17.187
"Yes," Mr. Barns said.

39
00:02:17.188 --> 00:02:19.595
"It doesn't look like anything from real life.

40
00:02:19.596 --> 00:02:22.261
But it has lots of action!"

41
00:02:22.262 --> 00:02:25.092
Mr. Barns hurried away to help another student.

42
00:02:25.093 --> 00:02:28.001
Terrell looked at Jack's painting.

43
00:02:28.002 --> 00:02:30.933
"It does have action," he said.

44
00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:36.317
Then he grinned at Roxy. "I know who could make really cool paintings!"

45
00:02:36.318 --> 00:02:42.820
Roxy rolled her eyes. "Terrell, Rocket Girl isn't an artist."

46
00:02:42.821 --> 00:02:44.599
Terrell shrugged.

47
00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:54.646
Roxy's watch beeped. She stepped away from her friends.

48
00:02:54.647 --> 00:02:58.582
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "What's wrong?"

49
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:02.148
"I need your help, Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

50
00:03:02.149 --> 00:03:05.955
"A vandal broke into the Metro City Art Museum last night.

51
00:03:05.956 --> 00:03:09.368
The vandal sprayed paint all over the place!"

52
00:03:09.369 --> 00:03:14.876
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said. "I'm on my way."

